{
  "format": [
    "Shared vectors of the proxy selection rules. lib/domain/proxySelection.test.ts and the Workspace guest's Python tests both read this file; a rule changes here and in both languages together.",
    "hints: normalize `input` into `output`; null means the text is not a hint.",
    "hosts: normalize `input` into `host`; null means it matches no hint. `site` is the site key of `host`.",
    "selection: start from `state`, or from the empty state {cursors: {}, failed: {}, sites: {}} when absent, and thread the state through `steps` in order. `select` passes `host` and `explicit` (absent means no choice; {kind: direct} or {kind: proxy, ref}) and expects `expect`, compared whole. `fail` records that `proxyId` failed on `host`. `state` on a step, when present, is the whole state after it, and key order does not matter. An empty map stays in the state; a site without failures has no key under `failed`.",
    "toTry: the active proxies a blocked result names for `host`, in order.",
    "blockedHttpStatuses: site responses that read as a block; they never count as a proxy failure.",
    "Selection outcomes: {kind: direct, reason: explicit|no_match}; {kind: proxy, proxyId, reason: explicit|hint|site, hint: <matched hint>|null}; {kind: failed, code, tried: [ids]}."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "blockedHttpStatuses": [401, 403, 407, 451, 498],
  "hints": [
    { "name": "a zone", "input": ".kz", "output": ".kz" },
    { "name": "a zone without its dot", "input": "kz", "output": ".kz" },
    { "name": "a domain", "input": "ozon.ru", "output": "ozon.ru" },
    { "name": "a domain with a leading dot", "input": ".ozon.ru", "output": "ozon.ru" },
    { "name": "a subdomain", "input": "seller.ozon.ru", "output": "seller.ozon.ru" },
    { "name": "upper case", "input": "OZON.RU", "output": "ozon.ru" },
    { "name": "an upper case zone", "input": ".KZ", "output": ".kz" },
    { "name": "surrounding spaces", "input": "  .kz ", "output": ".kz" },
    { "name": "a trailing dot", "input": "ozon.ru.", "output": "ozon.ru" },
    { "name": "a zone with a trailing dot", "input": ".kz.", "output": ".kz" },
    { "name": "an internationalized zone", "input": ".рф", "output": ".xn--p1ai" },
    { "name": "an internationalized zone in upper case", "input": ".РФ", "output": ".xn--p1ai" },
    { "name": "an internationalized domain", "input": "Яндекс.рф", "output": "xn--d1acpjx3f.xn--p1ai" },
    { "name": "an internationalized domain with a trailing dot", "input": "президент.рф.", "output": "xn--d1abbgf6aiiy.xn--p1ai" },
    { "name": "the ASCII form of an internationalized zone", "input": ".xn--p1ai", "output": ".xn--p1ai" },
    { "name": "an underscore", "input": "my_shop.kz", "output": "my_shop.kz" },
    { "name": "empty", "input": "", "output": null },
    { "name": "only spaces", "input": "   ", "output": null },
    { "name": "only a dot", "input": ".", "output": null },
    { "name": "two leading dots", "input": "..kz", "output": null },
    { "name": "two trailing dots", "input": "ozon.ru..", "output": null },
    { "name": "an empty label", "input": "ozon..ru", "output": null },
    { "name": "a wildcard", "input": "*.kz", "output": null },
    { "name": "a scheme", "input": "https://ozon.ru", "output": null },
    { "name": "a port", "input": "ozon.ru:443", "output": null },
    { "name": "a path", "input": "ozon.ru/catalog", "output": null },
    { "name": "userinfo", "input": "user@ozon.ru", "output": null },
    { "name": "a space inside", "input": "ozon .ru", "output": null },
    { "name": "several hints in one", "input": ".kz,.ru", "output": null },
    { "name": "an IPv4 address", "input": "93.184.216.34", "output": null },
    { "name": "a number", "input": "2130706433", "output": null },
    { "name": "a hexadecimal last label", "input": "example.0x7f", "output": null },
    { "name": "an IPv6 address", "input": "::1", "output": null },
    { "name": "a label starting with a hyphen", "input": "-ozon.ru", "output": null },
    { "name": "a label ending with a hyphen", "input": "ozon-.ru", "output": null },
    { "name": "a label over 63 characters", "input": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa.ru", "output": null },
    { "name": "an internationalized name with a slash", "input": "яндекс.рф/путь", "output": null },
    { "name": "digits written in full width read as an address", "input": "１２７.０.０.１", "output": null }
  ],
  "hosts": [
    { "name": "a plain host", "input": "www.ozon.ru", "host": "www.ozon.ru", "site": "ozon.ru" },
    { "name": "a registered domain", "input": "ozon.ru", "host": "ozon.ru", "site": "ozon.ru" },
    { "name": "a deep subdomain", "input": "a.b.c.ozon.ru", "host": "a.b.c.ozon.ru", "site": "ozon.ru" },
